<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>eBookShala | Your Digital Library</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/logo/eBookShala_Logo.svg">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700;800&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            background-color: #F8F5E9;
            color: #333;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; 
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, .logo, .section-title, #typing-headline {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px; 
        }

        .hero-section {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100vh;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero-video {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .video-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.4) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.7) 100%);
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .hero-content {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            z-index: 3;
            text-align: center;
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 900px; 
        }

        #typing-headline {
            font-size: clamp(40px, 8vw, 72px); 
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0 0 15px 0;
            min-height: clamp(45px, 8vw, 80px); 
            text-shadow: 2px 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        #typing-paragraph {
            font-size: clamp(16px, 2.5vw, 24px);
            color: #f8f8f8;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0 auto;
            max-width: 700px;
            min-height: 80px; 
            text-shadow: 1px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .cursor::after {
            content: '|';
            animation: blink 0.8s infinite;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        @keyframes blink {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0; }
        }

        .cta-container {
            margin-top: 35px;
            opacity: 0; 
            transform: translateY(20px);
            transition: opacity 1s ease, transform 1s ease;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .cta-container.show {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0); 
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 14px 32px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background-color: #d32f2f;
            color: white;
            border: 2px solid #d32f2f;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(211, 47, 47, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background-color: #b71c1c;
            border-color: #b71c1c;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background-color: transparent;
            color: white;
            border: 2px solid white;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background-color: white;
            color: #333;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .features-section {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 4;
        }

        .feature-box {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 250px;
        }

        .feature-box h3 {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #d32f2f;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .feature-box p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .trending-section {
            padding: 60px 50px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 28px;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-align: left;
            position: relative;
        }

        .section-title::after {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            width: 60px;
            height: 4px;
            background-color: #d32f2f;
            margin-top: 10px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .trending-container {
            display: flex;
            gap: 25px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            scrollbar-width: thin;
            scrollbar-color: #d32f2f #eee;
        }

        .trending-container::-webkit-scrollbar {
            height: 8px;
        }
        .trending-container::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #eee; 
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .trending-container::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background-color: #d32f2f; 
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .reveal-card {
            opacity: 0; 
            transform: translateX(100px); 
            transition: opacity 0.8s ease-out, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);
        }

        .reveal-card.show {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateX(0); 
        }

        .trending-container::-webkit-scrollbar {
            height: 8px;
        }
        .trending-container::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #eee; 
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .trending-container::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background-color: #d32f2f; 
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 15px;
            min-width: 180px;
            max-width: 180px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 260px;
            object-fit: cover;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
        }

        .card:hover img {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .card-title {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 0 0 6px 0;
            white-space: nowrap;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
            color: #333;
        }

        .card-author {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #777;
            margin: 0;
            white-space: nowrap;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
        }

        .about-platform-section {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 80px 60px;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 40px auto 80px auto;
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        }

        .about-header {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto 50px auto;
        }

        .center-title {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .center-title::after {
            margin: 15px auto 0 auto; 
        }

        .about-description {
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #555;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        .info-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .info-card {
            background-color: #F8F5E9; 
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .info-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
            background-color: #fff;
        }

        .info-icon {
            font-size: 45px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .info-card h3 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #333;
            margin: 0 0 15px 0;
        }

        .info-card p {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .about-logo {
            width: 70px;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto 20px auto;
            filter: brightness(0); 
            transform: perspective(600px) rotateY(0deg);
            transition: transform 1.5s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);
        }

        .about-logo.spin-once {
            transform: perspective(600px) rotateY(360deg);
        }

        .info-icon {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .info-icon svg {
            color: #d32f2f;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .info-card:hover .info-icon svg {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .faq-section {
            padding: 60px 20px;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto 40px auto;
        }

        .faq-container {
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .faq-item {
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .faq-question {
            padding: 20px 25px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #333;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            user-select: none;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .faq-question:hover {
            color: #d32f2f;
        }

        .faq-question::after {
            content: '+';
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #d32f2f;
            transition: transform 0.4s ease;
        }

        .faq-item.active .faq-question::after {
            transform: rotate(45deg);
        }

        .faq-answer {
            max-height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: max-height 0.4s ease-out, padding 0.4s ease;
            background-color: #faf9f5;
        }

        .faq-answer p {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0 25px 20px 25px;
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .faq-item.active .faq-answer {
            max-height: 300px; 
        }

        .final-cta-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d32f2f 0%, #9a0007 100%);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 70px 20px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .final-cta-section h2 {
            font-size: 36px;
            margin: 0 0 15px 0;
            color: white;
        }

        .final-cta-section p {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin: 0 0 30px 0;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .cta-btn-inverted {
            background-color: white;
            color: #d32f2f !important;
            border: 2px solid white !important;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .cta-btn-inverted:hover {
            background-color: transparent;
            color: white !important;
        }

        .community-stats-section {
            position: relative;
            background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524995997946-a1c2e315a42f?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-attachment: fixed; 
            padding: 90px 40px;
            max-width: 1120px;
            margin: 60px auto;
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .stats-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85) 0%, rgba(26, 5, 5, 0.75) 100%);
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .stats-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .text-light {
            color: #ffffff !important;
        }

        .text-light::after {
            background-color: #d32f2f !important;
        }

        .stats-subtitle {
            color: #e0e0e0; 
            text-align: center; 
            max-width: 600px; 
            margin: 0 auto 50px auto; 
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .stat-item {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, background 0.3s ease;
        }

        .stat-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .stat-item h3 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 52px;
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-shadow: 2px 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .stat-item p {
            font-size: 15px;
            margin: 0;
            color: #ffb3b3; 
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        }

        /* Split Text & Image Section */
        .split-section {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 80px 60px;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 60px auto 80px auto; 
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .split-content {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 60px;
        }

        .split-text {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .split-text .section-title {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .split-text p {
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .feature-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .feature-list li {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #444;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .feature-list li svg {
            color: #d32f2f;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .split-image-container {
            flex: 1;
            position: relative;
        }

        .split-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;
        }

        .split-image:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        .reveal-left {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateX(-50px);
            transition: opacity 0.8s ease-out, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);
        }

        .reveal-right {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateX(50px);
            transition: opacity 0.8s ease-out, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);
        }

        .reveal-left.show, .reveal-right.show {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateX(0);
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .split-section {
                padding: 50px 40px;
                margin: 40px 20px;
            }
            .split-content {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 40px;
            }
            .split-text {
                text-align: center;
            }
            .split-text .section-title::after {
                margin: 10px auto 0 auto; 
            }
            .feature-list li {
                justify-content: center;
                text-align: left;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .split-section {
                padding: 40px 20px;
                margin: 40px 15px;
            }
            .split-image {
                border-radius: 12px;
            }
            .feature-list li {
                font-size: 15px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .community-stats-section { 
                padding: 60px 30px; 
                margin: 40px 20px; 
                background-attachment: scroll; 
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .community-stats-section { 
                padding: 50px 20px; 
                margin: 30px 15px; 
            }
            .stat-item { 
                padding: 30px 20px; 
            }
            .stat-item h3 {
                font-size: 42px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .community-stats-section { 
                padding: 40px 20px; 
                margin: 20px 15px 40px 15px; 
            }
            .stat-item { 
                padding: 30px 20px; 
            }
        }


        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .features-section {
                gap: 20px;
                padding: 30px 15px;
            }
            .trending-section {
                padding: 40px 30px;
            }

            .about-platform-section {
                padding: 60px 40px;
                margin: 20px 20px 60px 20px;
            }

            .stats-grid { 
                gap: 20px; 
            }
            .stat-item { 
                min-width: 100%; 
                padding: 25px; 
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .hero-content {
                width: 95%;
            }
            
            .cta-container {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 10px;
            }

            .btn {
                width: 80%;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .features-section {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 30px;
            }

            .trending-section {
                padding: 40px 15px;
            }

            .card {
                min-width: 140px;
                max-width: 140px;
                padding: 10px;
            }

            .card img {
                height: 200px;
            }

            .about-platform-section {
                padding: 40px 20px;
                margin: 20px 15px 40px 15px;
            }

            .about-description {
                font-size: 16px;
            }

            .info-card {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }

            .faq-section {
                padding: 40px 15px;
            }
            .faq-question {
                font-size: 16px;
                padding: 15px 20px;
            }
            .final-cta-section h2 {
                font-size: 28px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <%- include('partials/navBar') %>

        <div class="hero-section">
            <video autoplay loop muted playsinline class="hero-video">
                <source src="/videos/heroSectionVideo.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            </video>
            
            <div class="video-overlay"></div>

            <div class="hero-content">
                <h1 id="typing-headline"></h1>
                <p id="typing-paragraph"></p>
                
                <div class="cta-container" id="cta-buttons">
                    <a href="/catalog" class="btn btn-primary">Browse Catalog</a>
                    <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-secondary">Join for Free</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="features-section">
            <div class="feature-box">
                <h3> Massive Library</h3>
                <p>Access thousands of bestsellers, academic texts, and hidden indie gems.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-box">
                <h3> Read Anywhere</h3>
                <p>Seamlessly sync your reading progress across your phone, tablet, and PC.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-box">
                <h3> Offline Access</h3>
                <p>Download your favorite titles and read them anytime without the internet.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="trending-section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Trending Now</h2>

            <div class="trending-container">
                <% trendingBooks.forEach(function(book) { %>
                    <a href="/book/<%= book.id %>" class="reveal-card" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
                        <div class="card" style="cursor: pointer;">
                            <img src="<%= book.formats['image/jpeg'] ? book.formats['image/jpeg'] : 'https://via.placeholder.com/150x240?text=No+Cover' %>"
                                alt="<%= book.title %>">

                            <p class="card-title">
                                <%= book.title %>
                            </p>

                            <p class="card-author">
                                <%= book.authors.length > 0 ? book.authors[0].name : "Unknown Author" %>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                <% }) %>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-platform-section">
            <div class="about-header">
                <img src="/logo/eBookShala_Logo.svg" alt="eBookShala Logo" class="about-logo" id="rotating-logo">
                
                <h2 class="section-title center-title">About eBookShala</h2>
                <p class="about-description">
                    eBookShala is your premier digital sanctuary for knowledge and imagination. We believe that reading should be accessible to everyone, breaking down the barriers of traditional reading. Whether you are looking for academic resources, timeless classics, or your next fiction adventure, we bring the world's best books directly to your screen.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="info-grid">
                <div class="info-card">
                    <div class="info-icon">
                        <svg width="48" height="48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.042A8.967 8.967 0 006 3.75c-1.052 0-2.062.18-3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 016 18c2.305 0 4.408.867 6 2.292m0-14.25a8.966 8.966 0 016-2.292c1.052 0 2.062.18 3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0018 18a8.967 8.967 0 00-6 2.292m0-14.25v14.25"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Vast Collection</h3>
                    <p>Explore thousands of curated titles. From historical archives to modern thrillers, our library is constantly growing to feed your curiosity.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="info-card">
                    <div class="info-icon">
                        <svg width="48" height="48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 15a4.5 4.5 0 004.5 4.5H18a3.75 3.75 0 001.332-7.257 3 3 0 00-3.758-3.848 5.25 5.25 0 00-10.233 2.33A4.502 4.502 0 002.25 15z"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Read Anywhere</h3>
